    "descriptionHtml": "There are a lot of App Stores for i OS pretending to be unrevokeable and TutuBox doesn&#39;t make here a lot of a difference. This new 3rd party App Store was designed to work on i OS 13 with access to some popular emulators, jailbreak tools, hacked games, and tweaked apps. Install TutuBox on your i Phone without a computer.<br><br>TutuBox works on both Jailbreak and non-Jailbreak devices running i OS 13. Same as all other free app stores, all apps are signed using an enterprise certificate, that can easily get revoked. Using a proxy can help you to avoid this situation.<br><br>Tutubox app is an excellent addition to the no revoke 3rd party app store for i Phones that allows you to install thousands of popular tweaked apps and games for free. It is designed to work on the latest i OS 13.x and i OS 14.x, regardless of the phone’s Jailbreaking status. Yes, you can use Tutubox to download best for free.<br><br>DISCLAIMER:<br>1. Unofficial Guide for TutuBox app complies with the United States copyright law &quot;fair use.&quot;",
